### Use with a REST client supporting .http files.
### Set accessToken as a private client/environment variable; do not commit it.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Authenticated greeting: 200, text/html body "Hello World!"
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing Authorization header: 401, errorCode missing_credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Malformed token: 401, message "malformed token"
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Authorization: Bearer not-a-jwt

### Undocumented/unimplemented route: 404, not a login operation
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
